{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Escape to the Afterlife</strong> is a horror game where the protagonist, who has passed away, searches for a path to the afterlife.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Movement:</strong> WASD + Mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interact:</strong> Left Click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Look Back:</strong> Right Click (Check behind without stopping while running)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run:</strong> Shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inventory:</strong> Tab</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Options:</strong> ESC</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Setting:</strong> Early Showa-era Japan, inspired by traditional Japanese folktales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Graphics:</strong> Low-poly, retro-style visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles:</strong> Solve puzzles using items and clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Action Horror:</strong> Escape from pursuing enemies and avoid deadly encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability:</strong> Two different endings</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569560?t=1742262893","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569560/0bf08f1785c99c2c6ae7de40893117f184b62a6e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742262893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569560/59d3f167004c67b45f47e48d057d1f241b5116ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742262893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569560/59d3f167004c67b45f47e48d057d1f241b5116ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742262893","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"des